id: overflowing-surge
name: Overflowing Surge
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/encounter
surge: true
adversaryActionCost: 1
# Overflowing Power (3)'s, open while it applies; its PCC uses are the Trait's `overflowing-surge.uses` (maneuvers.mjs maneuverUsesLeft).
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  An Adversary Action for a Surge of your choice, as an Instant Maneuver.
text: >
  Overflowing Power (3) [PCC/Encounter]: As an Instant Maneuver, you may spend an Adversary Action to use a Surge of your choice.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 1 Adversary Action
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Effect: Use either a Healing Surge or a Ki Surge.

